halation</article-title><source>J Appl Physiol</source><year>1994</year><volume>77</volume><fpage>2057</fpage><lpage>64</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7532647</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B119"><label>119</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Efimova</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Volokhov</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Iliaifar</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Hales</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Ligation of the bronchial artery in sheep attenuates early pulmonary changes following exposure to smoke</article-title><source>J Appl Physiol</source><year>2000</year><volume>88</volume><fpage>888</fpage><lpage>93</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10710383</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B120"><label>120</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sakuri</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Johnigan</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Kikuchi</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Effect of reduced bronchial circulation on lung fluid flux after smoke inhalation in sheep</article-title><source>J Appl Physiol</source><year>1998</year><volume>84</volume><fpage>980</fpage><lpage>6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9480960</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B121"><label>121</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Katahira</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Murakami</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Schmalstieg</surname><given-names>FC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Role of anti-L-selectin antibody in burn and smoke inhalation injury in sheep</article-title><source>Am J Physiol Lung cell Mol Physiol</source><year>2002</year><vol